#: src/Form/BiolandHomeWidgetsForm.php
msgid "Select the content types shown in the National Biosafety Framework swiper. Leave empty to use the defaults. This section shows site content only — nothing is pulled from the BCH central registry."
msgstr "Select the content types shown in the National Biosafety Framework swiper. Leave empty to use the defaults. This section shows site content only — nothing is pulled from the BCH central registry."

#: src/Form/BiolandHomeWidgetsForm.php
